      "parameters": {
        "content": "Bounded supervisor (no recursive agents): every 2 min ca_supervisor_tick() recovers stuck jobs (retry ladder, max attempts -> dead_letter), moves cooled-down circuits to half_open, alerts on backlog/dead letters/low disk. Recovery levels 1-6 live in ca_job_fail. Resource snapshots arrive from tools/host_reporter.ps1 (n8n cannot read host CPU/RAM by itself).",
        "height": 140,
        "width": 640
      },
      "id": "f83b32b1-2839-55fb-8738-3e05237df93d",
      "name": "Read me",
